"title": "yoke",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "yoke",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Wanpela <b>youk</b> em i wanpela samting bilong werim long nek na ol i wokim long plang, na em i gat tupela maus we ol manmeri i save yusim long pasim tupela man kau o tupela narapela animal wantaim. Orait ol animal i ken wokabaut wantaim na pulim wanpela plaw o wanpela kart o tul bilong brukim graun. Dispela youk i save helpim ol animal long wokabaut wantaim long wankain step na ol i ken pulim kago long seim mak na spit. Long mekim dispela, ol animal i nid long stap long seim sais.</p><p>Baibel sampela taim i save yusim youk olsem spesel toktok pasin bilong marit. Taim tupela manmeri i marit long wanpela narapela, tasol ol i no raitpela long wanpela narapela, yu ken tok olsem tupela i no youk wantaim long ikwal mak. Em i olsem tupela narapela narapela animal i traim long pulim wanpela kago, tasol ol i mekim long narapela narapela spit. Risalt bilong dispela em wanpela ron we i kalap kalap!</p><p>Ol manmeri i ken fosim wanpela man long karim wanpela youk sapos dispela man em i wanpela  <a href=\"#t126\">sleiv o wokboi nating</a> o wanpela kalabus man. Baibel sampela taim i yusim wod youk olsem wanpela tok long toktok long sleiv pasin o hevi. Taim wanpela man o meri i nid long wok hat, yu ken tok olsem em i karim wanpela hevi youk.</p>",
